# user-owned, NEVER touched by upgrades: everything else, notably
#   ~/.config/neva/identity.env, workspace *.local.md and USER.md,
#   all vault content folders (00-10, Food, Journal, Reviews), including the seeded
#   00 Inbox/inbox.md and 06 Memory/instincts/README.md (shipped once, then yours),
